      "shortDescription": "Pollard Pumps designs and manufactures positive-displacement rotary-vane pumps in France. Its official range covers pumps and motor-pump units, fluid-transfer and lubrication configurations, drum-emptying equipment and engineered pumping products.",
      "fullDescription": [
        "Official Pollard sources identify the business as a French designer and manufacturer of positive-displacement pumps operating since 1946. The company develops and produces its rotary-vane pump technology at its factory in Signes, France and is presented as a business of IPI Group.",
        "The documented catalogue includes standard pumps and electric motor-pump units across multiple displacement ranges, ATEX configurations, transfer pumps, strainers, drum-emptying equipment and special engineered products. Published applications cover wind-turbine gearbox lubrication, rail fuel transfer, transport tank loading and unloading, nuclear auxiliary systems, defence, cooling circuits, agricultural machinery, mining and other industrial fluid-transfer duties."
